{
  "algorithm": "AprioriMining",
  "version": "1.0",
  "seed": "0xA00000000000001",
  "date": "2026-06-04",
  "notes": [
    "Conformance vectors for AprioriMining (SubstrateML).  Both Swift and Rust",
    "ports must produce identical rules for each case.",
    "Item encoding: {\"field\": <u8>, \"value\": <u8>}.  All items sorted ascending",
    "by packed key (field<<8 | value) in antecedents and attribute lists.",
    "conviction is encoded as the string \"+Inf\" when confidence == 1.0.",
    "Floating-point values are exact IEEE-754 double results of small-integer",
    "divisions; assert with tolerance 1e-12 to guard against platform drift.",
    "am-002 dataset (N=5):",
    "  Row 0-2: {A=(f0v1), B=(f0v2)};  Row 3: {A=(f0v1), C=(f0v3)};  Row 4: {C=(f0v3)}",
    "  minSupport=0.5 (minCount=3); {C} not frequent (2 rows); {A}: 4, {B}: 3, {A,B}: 3",
    "  B->A: conf=1.0, lift=1.25, conv=+Inf;  A->B: conf=0.75, lift=1.25, conv=1.6",
    "  Sort order: both lift=1.25, evidenceCount=3 -> conf desc: B->A first."
  ],
  "vectors": [
    {
      "id": "am-001",
      "description": "Empty rows returns empty rules",
      "input": {
        "rows": [],
        "thresholds": {
          "minSupport": 0.5,
          "minConfidence": 0.5,
          "minLift": 1.0,
          "maxK": 2
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "rules": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "am-002",
      "description": "Five-row, two-item dataset: A=(f0v1), B=(f0v2) co-occur in rows 0-2; C not frequent",
      "input": {
        "rows": [
          { "attributes": [{"field": 0, "value": 1}, {"field": 0, "value": 2}] },
          { "attributes": [{"field": 0, "value": 1}, {"field": 0, "value": 2}] },
          { "attributes": [{"field": 0, "value": 1}, {"field": 0, "value": 2}] },
          { "attributes": [{"field": 0, "value": 1}, {"field": 0, "value": 3}] },
          { "attributes": [{"field": 0, "value": 3}] }
        ],
        "thresholds": {
          "minSupport": 0.5,
          "minConfidence": 0.5,
          "minLift": 1.0,
          "maxK": 2
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "rules": [
          {
            "antecedent": [{"field": 0, "value": 2}],
            "consequent": {"field": 0, "value": 1},
            "support": 0.6,
            "confidence": 1.0,
            "lift": 1.25,
            "conviction": "+Inf",
            "leverage": 0.12,
            "evidenceCount": 3
          },
          {
            "antecedent": [{"field": 0, "value": 1}],
            "consequent": {"field": 0, "value": 2},
            "support": 0.6,
            "confidence": 0.75,
            "lift": 1.25,
            "conviction": 1.6,
            "leverage": 0.12,
            "evidenceCount": 3
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
